          <li itemprop="classifications" itemscope repeat>
            <span itemprop="Code">C08F255/02</span>&mdash;<span itemprop="Description">Macromolecular compounds obtained by polymerising monomers on to polymers of hydrocarbons as defined in group C08F10/00 on to polymers of olefins having two or three carbon atoms</span>
