            <span itemprop="Code">C08J</span>&mdash;<span itemprop="Description">WORKING-UP; GENERAL PROCESSES OF COMPOUNDING; AFTER-TREATMENT NOT COVERED BY SUBCLASSES C08B, C08C, C08F, C08G or C08H</span>
